    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Over at the bar counter, Max vents to his best friend Kostya about how Vika criticizes him at home. Kostya suggests a clever tactic: catch Vika making a mistake of her own so she cannot scold him. Let's listen in Russian first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Ты что?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да так, семейное.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Меня Вика уже достала.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Пилит по каждому поводу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Найди какой-нибудь её косяк.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Тогда она не сможет тебя упрекнуть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Какой косяк?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Не знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Или бритвой твоей пользуется.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Бывает же такое?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да вроде нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Ищи.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Ты что?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What is wrong with you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да так, семейное.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Oh, just family stuff.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Меня Вика уже достала.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Vika has really worn me out.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Пилит по каждому поводу.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'She nags me over every little thing.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Найди какой-нибудь её косяк.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Find some mistake of hers.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Тогда она не сможет тебя упрекнуть.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Then she won't be able to reproach you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Какой косяк?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'What kind of mistake?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Не знаю.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I don't know.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Или бритвой твоей пользуется.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Or maybe she uses your razor.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "vika",
      "t": "Бывает же такое?",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Does that really happen?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "max",
      "t": "Да вроде нет.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'It doesn't seem so.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "kostya",
      "t": "Ищи.",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Keep looking.'",
